  Posts here talk to people who are awake at 2am and carrying something
  (stories-from-the-2am-hour, the-loneliness-gap). Ferni is not emergency help,
  so every post says where real help is, in the same words as
  what-ferni-is.njk. Always on: no front-matter switch turns it off.
  scripts/__tests__/blog-claims.test.ts checks that both layouts include it.
