<aside class="blog-post__care" aria-label="If you need someone right now">
  <p>
    If tonight feels like too much to carry, you don't have to carry it alone.
    In the US, call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a>, any hour, to reach the
    <a href="https://988lifeline.org/" rel="noopener">988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</a>.
    If you're outside the US, <a href="https://findahelpline.com/" rel="noopener">find a local line</a>.
    If you're in danger right now, call your local emergency number.
  </p>
